776 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Following the approval of a task flow\054 designers would then work on the low\055fidelity screens using the lo\055fi design system I built to simplify their design process\056 The goal was to focus the conversation on the specific parts of the design that needed attention and make the experience the centrepiece of the prototypes\056 This equipped designers to get feedback on the areas that were important for the experience\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 777 0 R
     /Pg 746 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

