782 0 obj
  << /ActualText (User testing surfaced a need for data visualization throughout key areas of the platform once the screens began to mature into their high\055fidelity designs\056 To address this\054 we needed to develop a concept and standardized process\054 which led to the development of the Insight Card\056 Unlike the Data Widgets\054 which we proposed for future designs\054 Insight Cards are minimalist in nature\054 only providing the user with three key pieces of information\072 the title\054 the display area\054 and actionable recommendations\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 783 0 R
     /Pg 746 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

