786 0 obj
  << /ActualText (By limiting the Insight Cards to select details that were important to the user\054 we were able to easily incorporate them into all our main section pages with minimal impact on the existing layout designs\056 We also provided users with the ability to hide the entire insight section if they weren\047t currently using it\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 787 0 R
     /Pg 746 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

