792 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Below is an example with test data that we used to demonstrate the capabilities of the insight cards\056 This current design is the MVP version as we planned to later on introduce visualizations like miniature bar charts\054 line graphs\054 etc\056\n\nIn addition to the Insight Cards\054 I developed the guidelines and concept designs for a future\055looking implementation of Data Widgets\056 These widgets serve a different purpose than the Insight Cards\054 as they are meant to provide the user with a lot more information while giving them the ability to manipulate how the data is shown to match their needs\056 Unfortunately\054 due to development feasibility constraints at the time\054 the widgets were deferred until after launch\054 which was when I was assigned to a new client project\056 Below you can see a brief concept draft that was created during the exploration phase\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 793 0 R
     /Pg 746 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

