798 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Overall\054 the RBC Clear project was a success for our client and our design team\056 The new cash management system won eight awards from The Digital Banker\054 Global Finance\054 and Infosys Finacle\054 including two Digital CX Awards for the platform\047s outstanding customer experience\054 and was recognized by Celent as a pioneer of next\055generation banking architecture\056 Although the project ran into challenges at the beginning\054 by leveraging our collective skills and my standardized design processes\054 we were able to persevere and ultimately lead the product team in building an experience that customers find valuable for their businesses\056)
     /K [ 26 ]
     /P 799 0 R
     /Pg 746 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

